PokemonTower_3F_Text_SabrinaTeachDreamEater::
    .string "This circle gathers more than\n"
    .string "memory.\p"
    .string "It gathers feeling, fear, grief,\n"
    .string "and the will to remain.\p"
    .string "I came here because the tower's\n"
    .string "astral energy called to me.\p"
    .string "While listening to it, I refined\n"
    .string "a PSYCHIC-type move.\p"
    .string "Would you like me to teach it?\p"
    .string "You will need a POKéMON that can\n"
    .string "learn DREAM EATER.$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_SabrinaChoosePokemon::
    .string "Very well.\n"
    .string "Choose the POKéMON to focus.$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_SabrinaComeBackWithPokemon::
    .string "Then return with a POKéMON whose\n"
    .string "mind can reach through dreams.$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_SabrinaTaughtDreamEater::
    .string "That is DREAM EATER.\p"
    .string "It draws strength from a sleeping\n"
    .string "foe through psychic focus.\p"
    .string "You remained peaceful inside\n"
    .string "the tower's astral pull.\p"
    .string "That emotional control is\n"
    .string "enough for an\n"
    .string "official challenge here.$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_GymGuideArrives::
    .string "SABRINA!\n"
    .string "I felt the tower settle.\p"
    .string "If a battle begins here, I will\n"
    .string "witness it as your GYM aide.$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_GymGuideWaiting::
    .string "The tower is quiet now.\p"
    .string "I will witness SABRINA's battle\n"
    .string "whenever you are ready.$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_SabrinaReadyToBattle::
    .string "Peace is not proven by silence\n"
    .string "alone.\p"
    .string "Let us see how your focus holds\n"
    .string "in battle.\p"
    .string "Are you ready to challenge me?$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_SabrinaDeclineBattle::
    .string "Then steady yourself.\p"
    .string "When your mind is ready, speak\n"
    .string "to me again.$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_SabrinaBattleIntro::
    .string "In this tower, thought and memory\n"
    .string "press close.\p"
    .string "Show me the shape of your will.$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_SabrinaDefeat::
    .string "Your focus did not waver.$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_SabrinaAfterBattle::
    .string "The MARSHBADGE is yours.\p"
    .string "You met the tower's pressure and\n"
    .string "answered it with peaceful control.\p"
    .string "I will return to SAFFRON GYM.\n"
    .string "Come there when you are ready.$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_AngelicaIntro::
    .string "Give…me…\n"
    .string "your light…$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_AngelicaDefeat::
    .string "Groan!\n"
    .string "The darkness is lifting.$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_AngelicaPostBattle::
    .string "I feel anemic and weak…$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_EmiliaIntro::
    .string "Urff…\n"
    .string "Kwaah!$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_EmiliaDefeat::
    .string "Something left me!\n"
    .string "Was that the spirit?$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_EmiliaPostBattle::
    .string "My hair didn't fall out!\n"
    .string "It was a malevolent spirit!$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_JenniferIntro::
    .string "Ke…ke…ke…\n"
    .string "ke…ke…ke!$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_JenniferDefeat::
    .string "Keee!\n"
    .string "The astral pull is breaking.$"

PokemonTower_3F_Text_JenniferPostBattle::
    .string "What's going on here?$"
